<item>
<title>中美俄元首首次会晤，和平宣言未提俄乌战事路透：宣言内容模糊习近平、普京、特朗普11月19日在深圳APEC期间举行三国元首</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10551</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10551</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:22:47 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>中美俄元首首次会晤，和平宣言未提俄乌战事</b><br/><b>路透：宣言内容模糊</b><br/><br/>习近平、普京、特朗普11月19日在深圳APEC期间举行三国元首首次会晤，会后发表四点《中俄美元首和平宣言》。宣言涉及联合国改革、精炼石油产品供应和核风险对话，并称国际刑事法院“不得滥用管辖权”，全文未提俄乌和伊朗战事。据美联社报道，普京正遭该法院通缉，美国也曾制裁该法院。<br/><br/>外交部长王毅称这是“和平峰会”，是“载入史册的标志性事件”。路透社引述分析人士称，宣言内容较为模糊，但这场由特朗普推动的三边峰会，为习近平提供了把自己塑造成全球事务核心参与者的平台；特朗普获高规格礼遇，却几乎没有具体成果。<br/><br/>据中媒报道，复旦学者吴心伯称，美方想拉中国谈核裁军，但宣言只写了核风险管控与防扩散，“中方不接这个茬”。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB">#政治</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4">#外交</a> <a href="?q=%23%E4%B9%A0%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3">#习近平</a> <a href="?q=%23%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3">#深圳</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《中国驻美国大使馆》<a href="https://us.china-embassy.gov.cn/chn/zgyw/202611/t20261119_12063191.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中俄美元首和平宣言</a><br/>《美联社》<a href="https://www.wfsb.com/2026/11/19/nuclear-arms-ending-wars-iran-ukraine-top-agenda-trump-xi-putin-meeting/?outputType=amp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Trump, Xi and Putin hold rare 3-way talks on nuclear risks but deliver no breakthroughs（特朗普、习近平与普京罕见三方会谈聚焦核风险，但无突破）</a><br/>《路透社》<a href="https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20261121-%E8%B7%AF%E9%80%8F%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90-%E4%B9%A0%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E5%80%9F%E5%B3%B0%E4%BC%9A%E5%B7%A9%E5%9B%BA%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%8C%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E8%8E%B7%E7%A4%BC%E9%81%87%E4%BD%86%E6%97%A0%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E6%88%90%E6%9E%9C" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">路透分析：习近平借峰会巩固国际地位，特朗普获礼遇但无实质成果</a>（via 法广中文编译）<br/>《凤凰网》<a href="https://news.ifeng.com/c/8yGsGMkmogx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中俄美元首会晤能否常态化？吴心伯：没理由不搞第二次和第三次</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/cdmKOrHXE2x_orXPh5Uks38qjSWK77PmpQrMmwCfSzjpvMt_wdbB31p3t1IBO2Mem6Ai5U4nck6dmyQokVgAtXQb4qCfB1oFSiNc5TSYAMFjgZxc0XWLZlf_d63xcRAxNGfqolpqX9i1nJCVMpTzv4BQCikyu_Aj9ayMcIlFOlUzWtG5jy2sug7EB7U3eCEO4ea_b4xrukYAZCZqmcjHKzoxFK-pLrlf3wvJ-oa0Xe1DgxcoQe4XnEGOI1tfZi_HnIyLVipiqiCSn9p20FpN4iTPpXAZzTXo8OP0hNDQzqxoPkdJj9N3jEe8Z5h79_tkA0Ro-Iqw2ETVFq_UJOCKrQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/VJe22XjUUpqkQ5syZZ87m14am8IkcgKUyhlKb4HenRKCratJ6AvTAKTPH2QYY4vHJw-jWtSsYsa5okQA0fbM_j1BwZtS7bPh5wYgKS4mAX6llz5VAVXJZO1d86VPNO3buV4bwRT4cMGtm0DD_ZOO0YPaiCjDOuVGrg2YGuFqxAxS4bnNTwuEQ--SIXtUpV4RWoPWC4Qcqb9tbvQlprZ-CVvJZTAOUiKXvhRiX-pWmvkYI8T0nE-HOEfIDmrzj6s7LzTBY_iTlgBylsah2_elwFqpRY3HM3b2_5B70Y-N_bKLZEOZXoRtHYj4b-5_yrFuHHxBdk4aGgIwmVkdd9ObbA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/reEnlfzs-lYQay9t6rvaCc-xGlCtABfPQiGX073NV8FNaGTkoBzdnEth7WVVTTpjb80i3l9twzkjQ5QHOCbiK-VMdQbkvxj_26_dLIgDCRRY28GILrV-RadCM7E7G5ijLXaQN1l8l_5cjJ6mz20mX2wfnA1NzJiF-VaDPKQrYGtCYUOOIKoX-ILrIGodL7ECHRLDXAmD6YA0LwiyTEf8aq7P54BX9di51zmmRDIp6oG-5VQ4FSHZKb5XaHlSTcszKtUbHdTrT8noYGVBZRXRHZ3TLKteHThClxyUO5PVQBqlkdes0w-bX4XYzsuOeQkQvAjr5GjyZWy0cEk7zUOT9g.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/kw15MN6_ubWuEBoNBXLBAWqswTbcAwNBiJFizI4riAwCEjpnZ8YTVQSrzaLvITmzTx1eDo9tTxrqbbXMyr5D8uL2bh1dECaGMbJzkoFNDqos8ldyG_DdMFkKiQB8qHokfFG4rEfzaa_zydavu0RP_DkUoOSy4dvw9DNqkOZJwEv5oQUOWxGth0mmK6LjNfjcrJALjYQw96fztLfo8OM4Qu6ylrcV3tcVvTQ1gLKzHErWK87x1lh5oiwiz_-YlVT5GSO2HdBFXQmDMsVnTPuQn0qJg8LpIGalGR5-5RgD4xXp36JhJPVo2in3Y3pgW8YDCYLLSlES9jaR4_QVGid8jw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-re